{"parse": {"title": "养成材料", "pageid": 93889, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p>指洞悉材料、共鸣材料、狂想材料、塑造材料、心相材料、荒原材料等各类用于游戏内角色或其它玩法内容养成升级的物品。\n</p><p>在此查看它们的具体内容：<b><img alt=\"Main icon.svg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Main_icon.svg/16px-Main_icon.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Main_icon.svg/24px-Main_icon.svg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/Main_icon.svg/32px-Main_icon.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><span style=\"user-select:none; padding-left:0\">&#160;</span>主条目：</b><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%A9%E5%93%81%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8\" title=\"物品列表\">物品列表</a>\n</p></div>", "categories": [], "displaytitle": "养成材料"}}